  m_Name: MonkIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Grieving Monk
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  dialogue:
  - Traveller... please, a moment.
  - A shadow attacked my village. It killed everyone.
  - My brothers, my students... all gone.
  - I alone survived. I am too old to fight it.
  - The creature lurks to the south. It must be destroyed.
  - Slay it, and I will give you my sacred charm.
  - It will make you strong enough to face a king.
  - Here, take this heal first. You will need it.
